abstract: "Reproducible Python pipeline for the IEEE Access paper \"A Seven-Year Higher-Order Ambisonics Recording Corpus\": corpus-wide figures (geography, timeline, room acoustics, loudness, session inventory), LaTeX-macro generation for every number the pipeline computes, the paired block-bootstrap uncertainty analysis of the microphone-comparison results, an open re-encoding of the deposited ZM-1 capsule signals under six regularization settings, and the dataset card (datasheet, metadata schema, partition table, checksums) of the deposit. The recording corpus itself is deposited separately at doi.org/10.34808/w8bx-2094."
